# GroupFinding
# G3Cv11
# v11
# 2025-10-08
# Trystan Lambert <trystan.lambert@uwa.edu.au>
#
# Galaxy groups for the G09, G12, G15, and G23 regions.
# Groups built using Nessie and new GAMA III photometry based on profound (gkInputCat)#
# See Lambert (2025) for more details.
#
GroupID        1   -              -                       Unique group ID                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
Nfof           2   -              -                       Group multiplicity                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
IterCenRA      3   deg            pos.eq.ra;meta.main     RA of the iterative central galaxy (J2000)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
IterCenDec     4   deg            pos.eq.dec;meta.main    Dec of the iterative central galaxy (J2000)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
IterCenZ       5   -              src.redshift            Redshift of the iterative central galaxy                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
IterCenUberID  6   -              meta.id                 Reference ID of the iterative central galaxy (preferred position of the group centre)                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
Zfof           7   -              src.redshift;meta.main  Median redshift of the group                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
Rad50          8   Mpc/h          phys.size.radius        Group radius defined by the 50th percentile group member, based on the projected distance away from IterCenID                                                                                                                                                                                                       
Rad100         9   Mpc/h          phys.size.radius        Group radius defined by the most distant group member, based on the projected distance away from IterCenID                                                                                                                                                                                                          
Rad1Sig        10  Mpc/h          phys.size.radius        Group radius defined by the 68th percentile group member, based on the projected distance away from IterCenID                                                                                                                                                                                                       
VelDisp        11  km/s           phys.veloc              Group velocity dispersion, corrected for the total group velocity dispersion error (VelErr); set to zero if VelErr>VelDispRaw                                                                                                                                                                                       
VelDispErr     12  km/s           phys.veloc              Total group velocity dispersion error                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
MassProxy      13  -              -                       Proxy for dynamical group mass estimated via M propto Rad50 * VelDisp^2; value listed corresponds to A=1 in Eq. 18 of Robotham et al. (2011), i.e. calibrated mass is given by A*M, with A the scaling factor described in section 4.3 of Robotham et al. (2011)                                                    
TotFluxProxy   14  -              -                       Proxy for group total r-band luminosity down to M_r - 5 log_10 h = -14 in solar luminosities. It is based on the total observed r-band flux and the fraction of light (as estimated from the global galaxy LF) observable at the group redshift; value listed corresponds to B=1 in Eq. 22 of Robotham et al. (2011)
BCGUberID      15  -              meta.id                 GAMA ID of BCG                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
BCGRA          16  deg            pos.eq.ra               RA of BCG (J2000)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
BCGDec         17  deg            pos.eq.dec              Dec of BCG (J2000)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
BCGZ           18  -              src.redshift            Z of BCG                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
CenRA          19  deg            pos.eq.ra               RA of group for a r-band luminosity weighted CoM of the system (J2000)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
CenDec         20  deg            pos.eq.dec              Dec of group for a r-band luminosity weighted CoM of the system (J2000)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
TotRmag        21  mag - 5log(h)  phys.magAbs             r-band absolute magnitude of the group, obtained by summing the r-band luminosities of its members                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
MassA          22  Msun/h         phys.mass               Mass proxy times the global A factor required to get a median unbaised halo mass estimate (A=10.0, see Robotham et al. 2011 section 4.3 for details)                                                                                                                                                                
LumB           23  Lsun/h^2       phys.luminosity         TotFluxProxy times the global B factor required to get a median unbaised r-band luminosity estimate (B=1.04, see Robotham et al. 2011 section 4.4 for details)                                                                                                                                                      
MassAfunc      24  Msun/h         phys.mass               Mass proxy times the functional A factor which is a function of Nfof and IterCenZ (see Robotham et al. 2011 section 4.3 for details)                                                                                                                                                                                
LumBfunc       25  Lsun/h^2       phys.luminosity         TotFluxProxy times the functional B factor which is a function of Nfof and IterCenZ (see Robotham et al. 2011 section 4.4 for details)                                                                                                                                                                              
GAMARegion     26  -              -                       The GAMA region the galaxy is in.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
